    "category": "bid",
    "issueTitle": "Underbid opportunity — \"gender powder cannon\" converting at $33.14 CPP (well below breakeven $49.35)",
    "whatToFix": "Switch the Powder Cannons ad group from manual bidding to Target ROAS bidding strategy to automatically increase bids for the profitable 'gender powder cannon' keyword.",
    "whyItShouldChange": "This keyword is converting at $33.14 CPP which is 33% below your breakeven point of $49.35, meaning you're leaving money on the table by underbidding. Target ROAS bidding will let Google's AI automatically raise bids when it spots profitable conversion opportunities for this high performing keyword. You'll capture additional profitable conversions worth an estimated $9.94 per month while maintaining your target 3x ROAS.",
    "projectedDollarImpact": 9.94,
    "projectedImpactDirection": "earn",
    "currentValue": {
      "criterionId": "593722840075",
