    "whyItShouldChange": "The Search Cannons campaign is burning $852 in spend at 1.51x ROAS, well below the 3x target and 2x breakeven threshold, while the PMAX campaign is hitting 3x ROAS and likely constrained by budget. This misallocation is costing the business profitable conversions by funding unprofitable traffic instead of scaling what works. Budget reallocation should generate an additional $1270.59 per month by shifting spend from 1.51x ROAS traffic to 3x ROAS opportunities.",
